== Effect ==
* Spawns an egg [[familiar]], which cracks and turns into a random [[friendly]] [[monster]] when Isaac is hurt.
** The egg regenerates upon entering a different room.
** The usefulness of the enemy depends on how many consecutive [[room]]s have been cleared without getting hurt.

== Notes ==
* {{dlc|r}} [[Familiar]]s that follow behind Isaac have a certain priority in how close their position is to him over other familiars, with Mystery Egg having the lowest priority at {{dlc|nr+}} 6th / {{dlc|r+}} 8th and thus being farther from Isaac than familiars of different priorities.
* Mystery Egg will activate when taking non-hostile damage (such as from a {{m|Blood Donation Machine}} or {{r|Curse Room}} door).
* For [[Greed Mode|Greed Mode and Greedier Mode]], the usefulness of the enemy is based on waves cleared rather than rooms.
