== Bugs ==
{{bug|dlc=nr|When using {{t|Extension Cord|n}} with Mystery Egg, after the egg turns into a friendly enemy, the electricity shoots out into a random corner of the room.}}
{{bug|When the egg turns into a friendly {{e|Mask + Heart||Heart}}, it will sometimes act as the heart companion for a mask already in the room resulting in an unbeatable room.}}
{{bug|Each use of {{i|Glowing Hourglass}} that does not move Isaac to a different room than the one he is currently in (such as the starting room of a new floor) will duplicate friendly enemies.}}

